WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:04.780
Every child has a spark, but not every child gets the chance to show it.

2
00:00:04.830 --> 00:00:06.610
This is GranthAI.

3
00:00:06.660 --> 00:00:11.070
In Sanskrit, granth means a book, and its root means to tie together.

4
00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:15.407
We tie learning, people and opportunity together, around every child.

5
00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:23.480
Across the world, talented children fall behind, not for lack of ability, but for lack of support.

6
00:00:23.530 --> 00:00:28.740
In Ireland, only fifty-four percent of children in care complete the Leaving Cert.

7
00:00:28.790 --> 00:00:32.724
And one teacher cannot sit beside twenty-five children every evening.

8
00:00:34.083 --> 00:00:35.733
It starts with a profile.

9
00:00:35.783 --> 00:00:37.093
Aoife is nine.

10
00:00:37.143 --> 00:00:40.873
She picks what she loves: football, space and drawing.

11
00:00:40.923 --> 00:00:46.059
From her first answers, a Bayesian model starts tracking what she knows, and what to review next.

12
00:00:47.417 --> 00:00:48.717
Here's the difference.

13
00:00:48.767 --> 00:00:52.717
Aoife asks a general chatbot: what's three quarters plus a half?

14
00:00:52.767 --> 00:00:55.287
It hands her the answer, and she copies it.

15
00:00:55.337 --> 00:00:58.097
GranthAI asks her to try first.

16
00:00:58.147 --> 00:01:05.269
When she answers four sixths, it spots the exact mistake, draws the pieces, and lets her find five quarters herself.

17
00:01:06.617 --> 00:01:08.887
It works for every kind of question.

18
00:01:08.937 --> 00:01:17.347
Ask it to write your science homework, and it opens your teacher's class notes and a diagram of a leaf, then asks what the plant needs from the sun.

19
00:01:17.397 --> 00:01:23.947
Ask it to help you revise, and it builds a quick quiz on your weakest topics, and suggests a book you'll love.

20
00:01:23.997 --> 00:01:25.887
It never hands out answers.

21
00:01:25.937 --> 00:01:27.382
It helps children reach them.

22
00:01:28.717 --> 00:01:31.877
Her feed follows her interests, to keep her curious.

23
00:01:31.927 --> 00:01:38.677
Gentle check-ins let her share how she feels, and if something is wrong, GranthAI never keeps secrets.

24
00:01:38.727 --> 00:01:40.606
It connects her with a trusted adult.

25
00:01:41.950 --> 00:01:43.750
Now picture four schools.

26
00:01:43.800 --> 00:01:45.650
Each child is a node.

27
00:01:45.700 --> 00:01:56.400
Our ranking algorithms link children who share the same passions, across school walls, and the network settles into clusters: a space club, a coding crew, an art studio.

28
00:01:56.450 --> 00:02:00.113
Aoife joins pupils from two other schools to build a project together.

29
00:02:01.450 --> 00:02:07.930
Each club is matched with a vetted retired teacher as a mentor, by subject, language and time.

30
00:02:07.980 --> 00:02:12.175
Children gain role models, and retired teachers gain meaningful work.

31
00:02:13.517 --> 00:02:15.477
Teachers get their time back.

32
00:02:15.527 --> 00:02:27.877
GranthAI shows which topics the class understands and where they struggle, then helps plan the lesson: objectives, a hands-on activity, and a quick check, built from the curriculum and the teacher's own materials.

33
00:02:29.217 --> 00:02:34.086
Future Me turns interests into real routes, from college courses to apprenticeships.

34
00:02:35.450 --> 00:02:43.290
And it's safe by design: no ads, no selling data, no emotion detection, built for GDPR and the EU AI Act.

35
00:02:44.650 --> 00:02:47.150
We are starting in Ireland's DEIS schools.

36
00:02:47.200 --> 00:02:48.780
Next, the UK.

37
00:02:48.830 --> 00:02:52.680
Then Europe, where millions of children learn in a second language.

38
00:02:52.730 --> 00:02:56.850
And one day, every community where one tablet serves a whole class.

39
00:02:56.900 --> 00:02:58.100
GranthAI.

40
00:02:58.150 --> 00:03:01.362
Not another chatbot, but a whole team around every child.

